  "description": "1-3. **Bamireul Nuga Ara?** (밤일을 누가 알아?) \\[Gajimaru x Kkwonggogi\\]\n4-6. **Gwaenchana, Chuwodo** (괜찮아, 추워도) \\[Gajimaru x Munjea\\]\n7-9. **Ujuui Byeol** (우주의 별) \\[Jo9\\]\n10-12. **Neoegero** (너에게로) \\[KimR x Chun\\]\n13-15. **Wiheomhan Mulgeoniroda** (위험한 물건이로다) \\[Gajimaru x Chiryong\\]\n16-18. **Neukdaewa Samhyeongje** (늑대와 삼형제) \\[KimR x Kkwonggogi\\]\n19-21. **Doctor daddy** (Doctor daddy) \\[Munjea\\]\n22-23. **a second time** (a second time) \\[Jo9\\]\n24-26. **Yeoninui Jogeon** (연인의 조건) \\[MEPI\\]\n27-28. **Han Imman Juseyo** (한 입만 주세요) \\[CH\\_J x Chun\\]\n29-31. **Ending-e Daehayeo** (엔딩에 대하여) \\[Noru\\]\n32-33. **Galgeupjeung Angma** (갈급증 악마) \\[Munjea\\]\n34-36.. **Momeuro Gapeulgeyo** (몸으로 갚을게요) \\[Gajimaru x off\\]\n37-39. **Jaldoelgeoya** (잘될거야) \\[Junbo x Bieup\\]",
